 "description": "My friend and his brother are using DS JP deck's right now, so, I thought I'd give this one a go.",
 "strategy": "The main objective of this deck is to put the DS JP player in a bind. Force draining in space, while replacing my opponent's site's with my own. Devaronians, holding the docking bay, not by themselves, of coarse. A Gift to keep those force drains and destiny draws down. Ultimatum, is in here to put a bind on force draining at Droid Workshop. Keep Chewie, Han, and Organa all together, helps a lot if I draw Protector. Oola, to stop those nasty Bounty Hunters. Loje Nella must put a stop to that evil Mosep (SP?). Grans, help retrieve force with Civil Disorder. And Garon Nas Tal, gives Sai'torr Kal Fas a boost. I've played with a older version of this deck, the one my friend made for me, almost won. So, we'll see how well this version does. Hopefully pretty well. Thanks.",
